<section class="about">
    <div class="container">        
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-4 g-lg-5">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="style_head animation-top">Proven. Affordable. Reliable.</h3>
                    <h2 class="head2 animation-top">P-Type PERC Series</h2>
                    <p class="animation-bottom">The Contendre P-Type PERC Series is engineered for reliable solar output at an accessible price point.
                    Using M10 (182mm) mono PERC half-cut cells with 10 busbars, these modules reach up to 21.48% efficiency and 600 Wp output.They’re available in both bifacial (glass-to-glass) and monofacial (white/transparent backsheet) variants, supporting flexible use across multiple installations. 
                    </p>
                    <p class="animation-bottom">Built for durability, they offer PID-free, low LID protection, and a low temperature coefficient, enabling steady generation in real-world conditions. Ideal for residential rooftops, housing societies, commercial warehouses, and solar farms, these panels perform with minimal maintenance.
                    </p>
                    <p class="animation-bottom">All modules use GRADE A cells, and are backed by 12 years of product warranty and up to 30 years of performance assurance (for bifacial variants).They also meet DCR (Domestic Content Requirement) compliance standards for government-linked projects.With exceptional mechanical resistance, smart cell architecture, and cost-effective performance, this series strikes the perfect balance of price and productivity.</p>
                    <div class="mt-3">
                    <a class="coman_btn animation-bottom" href="javascript:void(0);">Request Quote <img src="{{ asset('public/front/images/arrow.svg') }}"alt="arrow"></a>
                    </div>                                       
                </div>

            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <img class=" img-fluid animation-zoom-in" src="{{ asset('public/front/images/p-type_intro.png') }}" alt="image">
            </div>            
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
