          <h2 class="sub_head">Less Hot Spot Shading Effects</h2>
           <p>Advanced half-cell configuration minimizes resistive losses and lowers the risk of hotspots. This ensures better safety, improved efficiency, and longer lifespan of the modules.</p>
       
       </div>
       <div class="feature_box">
